  standard deviation at the ten most stabilising sites of the mean map:
    0.69  0.69  0.67  0.69  0.66  0.67  0.72  0.67  0.66  0.72

  A design selects from the most stabilising sites. If the spread there is
  comparable to the separation between candidates, no single frame's map
  can rank them and the ensemble mean is the quantity to design against.

